{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":10163003,"ns":0,"title":"Bruhat order","extract":"In mathematics, the Bruhat order (also called the strong order, strong Bruhat order, Chevalley order, Bruhat–Chevalley order, or Chevalley–Bruhat order) is a partial order on the elements of a Coxeter group, that corresponds to the inclusion order on Schubert varieties.","description":"Partial order on a Coxeter group","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}